            booleanDistinctValuesCount(OptionalLong.of(0), OptionalLong.of(10), OptionalLong.empty()),
            booleanDistinctValuesCount(OptionalLong.of(1), OptionalLong.of(10), OptionalLong.empty())))).isEqualTo(Estimate.of(2));
